<title>BRAZIL: Brazil to announce November federal tax revenues.</title>
<headline>Brazil to announce November federal tax revenues.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's Federal Tax Secretariat will announce tax revenues for the month of November at 3 p.m. (1700 GMT), the secretariat said in a statement.</p>
<p>In October, Brazil raised 7.9 billion reais in federal taxes, taking the total for the first ten months of the year to 76.906 billion reais, up from 69.301 billion reais in the same period last year.</p>
<p>-- William Schomberg, Brasilia newsroom 5561 2230358</p>
